                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1163000                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR W11633 OCH W11635-FILERNA FÖR ATT BEVAKA      *        
*                VILKA ERSÄTTNINGSMEDDELANDEN SOM VIA VIPS SKA         *        
*                SKICKAS TILL USA RESP CANADA.                         *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KENT JEBSEN                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  DECEMBER 96                                           *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11630D1                                                                   
%W11173    (W11633-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W11630D2                                                                   
%W11635    (W11635-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE TEMPFIL  VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (9 0)                                           
TEMP-IDARTNR     1   5  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-OLD   6   2  P                                                       
TEMP-KDERS-NEW   8   2  P                                                       
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11630D3 FB (11 0)                                                         
%W11631    (W11631-)                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE W11630D4 FB (12 0)                                                         
%W11173    (W11633SORT-)                                                        
*                                                                               
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  WORKING STORAGE                     *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
SPAR-IDARTNR     W  5 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-OLD   W  2 P                                                         
SPAR-KDERS-NEW   W  2 P                                                         
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
********SORTERAR INKOMMANDE TRANSFILEN OCH BEHANDLAR EVENTUELLA                 
*******ARTIKELNUMMERDUBBLETTER                                                  
*                                                                               
SORT W11630D1 TO W11630D4 USING (W11633-IDARTNR, W11633-IDLOPNR)                
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W11630D4                                        +                     
                                         FINISH  Z-FINIT                        
IF RECORD-COUNT = 1                                                             
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11633SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11633SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11633SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
IF SPAR-IDARTNR = W11633SORT-IDARTNR                                            
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11633SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
ELSE                                                                            
    TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                               
    TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                             
    TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                             
    PUT TEMPFIL                                                                 
  SPAR-IDARTNR   = W11633SORT-IDARTNR                                           
  SPAR-KDERS-OLD = W11633SORT-KDERS-OLD                                         
  SPAR-KDERS-NEW = W11633SORT-KDERS-NEW                                         
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
Z-FINIT.  PROC                                                                  
      TEMP-IDARTNR   = SPAR-IDARTNR                                             
      TEMP-KDERS-OLD = SPAR-KDERS-OLD                                           
      TEMP-KDERS-NEW = SPAR-KDERS-NEW                                           
      PUT TEMPFIL                                                               
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (TEMPFIL KEY(TEMP-IDARTNR) W11630D2 KEY(W11635-IDARTNR))              
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
  W11631-IDARTNR                 =  W11635-IDARTNR                              
  IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW              =  W11635-KDERS                                
    W11631-KDERS                 =  W11635-KDERS                                
    W11631-FLERSATT-USA          = 'N'                                          
    W11631-FLERSATT-CAN          = 'N'                                          
    IF W11635-FLERSATT-USA       = 'J'                                          
        W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA     = 'N'                                          
    ELSE                                                                        
        W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA     = 'J'                                          
    END-IF                                                                      
    IF W11635-FLERSATT-CAN       = 'J'                                          
        W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN     = 'N'                                          
    ELSE                                                                        
        W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN     = 'J'                                          
    END-IF                                                                      
    PUT W11630D3                                                                
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  0                                           
      W11631-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
      W11631-FLERSATT-USA        = 'N'                                          
      W11631-FLERSATT-CAN        = 'N'                                          
      IF W11635-FLERSATT-USA     = 'J'                                          
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA   = 'N'                                          
      ELSE                                                                      
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA   = 'J'                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
      IF W11635-FLERSATT-CAN     = 'J'                                          
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN   = 'N'                                          
      ELSE                                                                      
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN   = 'J'                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
      IF W11631-KDERS > 0                                                       
         IF W11631-KDERS < 20                                                   
            W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA       = 'J'                                    
            W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN       = 'J'                                    
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
      PUT W11630D3                                                              
    ELSE                                                                        
      IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW          =  0                                           
          W11631-KDERS           =  0                                           
          W11631-FLERSATT-USA    =  W11635-FLERSATT-USA                         
          W11631-FLERSATT-CAN    =  W11635-FLERSATT-CAN                         
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA   = 'N'                                          
          W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN   = 'N'                                          
          PUT W11630D3                                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
ELSE                                                                            
  IF TEMPFIL                                                                    
    IF TEMP-KDERS-NEW            >  0                                           
      W11631-IDARTNR             =  TEMP-IDARTNR                                
      W11631-KDERS               =  TEMP-KDERS-NEW                              
      W11631-FLERSATT-USA        = 'N'                                          
      W11631-FLERSATT-CAN        = 'N'                                          
      W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA       = 'J'                                          
      W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN       = 'J'                                          
      PUT W11630D3                                                              
    END-IF                                                                      
  ELSE                                                                          
    IF W11630D2                                                                 
      W11631-IDARTNR             =  W11635-IDARTNR                              
      W11631-KDERS               =  W11635-KDERS                                
      W11631-FLERSATT-USA        =  W11635-FLERSATT-USA                         
      W11631-FLERSATT-CAN        =  W11635-FLERSATT-CAN                         
      W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA       = 'J'                                          
      W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN       = 'J'                                          
      IF W11635-KDERS > 0                                                       
         IF W11635-KDERS < 20                                                   
            W11631-FLSALDOCH-USA       = 'N'                                    
            W11631-FLSALDOCH-CAN       = 'N'                                    
         END-IF                                                                 
         PUT W11630D3                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
